Start();
register(EnvT);
define
    envTwice "styles" "utilities" "styles";
    rqFiles form="firstLight" fileNames:=envTwice;
    ;
cout "EN PAGE files":;
show(rqFiles);
search EnvT FORMs Utilities cOLOr fONTs sTYLEs list;
define
    envList code={
        for grup in loadedFiles; attributes
            glN = string $*grup.taG$;
            cout "loaded" glN:;
        };
    envPath code={
        epP = string $showPath["path"]$;
        cout "showPath" epP:;
        };
    envRootTry code={
        erR := environment["root"];
        *erR = "elsewhere";
        showPath.path = "IncantForms/PDF/output.pdf";
        showPathRoot();
        envPath();
        *erR = ".";
        showPath.path = "IncantForms/PDF/output.pdf";
        showPathRoot();
        envPath();
        };
    envShort "FORMs" "Utilities";
    envNoReg "FORMs" "noSuchRegistry";
    rqShort form:=firstLight searchNames:=envShort;
    rqNoReg form:=firstLight searchNames:=envNoReg;
    rqPlain form:=firstLight;
    ;
cout "EN PAGE loaded":;     envList();
cout "EN PAGE path":;       envPath();
cout "EN PAGE short":;      show(rqShort);
cout "EN PAGE noreg":;      show(rqNoReg);
cout "EN PAGE plain":;      show(rqPlain);
cout "EN PAGE again":;      envList();
cout "EN PAGE root":;       envRootTry();
cout "EN PAGE end":;
cerr "ENVT SENTINEL":;
stop();

envT -- the kant environment, first piece (SEQ 724, ruled 2026-11-20). environment (incant/setup) holds root, paths and
forShow, show's defaults: searchNames, fileNames, stageNames. A request names the member it replaces: searchNames:= or
fileNames:= (search:= would write onto the search command). Run after Start() alone, like showBootT. Every draw is to
output.pdf, Tony's: formsPop sets it aside and puts it back (a top-level showPath.path write after a bootstrap show crashes,
exit 139, on trunk too; measured SEQ 724).
files    show(rqFiles): firstLight is not defined, so show loads it from the stash, with the request's fileNames:= in place
         of environment's: styles, utilities, styles -- each loaded once, and unitTests not at all.
loaded   the one list of loaded files: styles and utilities, once each.
path     showPath derives from environment.root: with root "." it is the relative path itself.
short    a request whose searchNames:= names FORMs and Utilities only: it draws (the form's colours were bound at its define).
         It names no fileNames, so environment's stand: unitTests, not loaded yet, loads first (deferred), then it draws.
noreg    searchNames:= naming noSuchRegistry: refused by name, nothing drawn.
plain    a request naming only form:= keeps every default: it draws.
again    after three more shows the loaded list is styles, utilities, unitTests: nothing loaded twice.
root     environment's root set to elsewhere and showPath re-derived: elsewhere/IncantForms/PDF/output.pdf, so the derivation
         is real; root put back to "." and the path with it.
